  <title>Online Income Positions</title>
  <link>https://www.master-7rqtwti-uu4o3wqcnw2yk.us.platform.sh/research/data-sources/online-income-positions</link>
  <description>&lt;span&gt;Online Income Positions&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span&gt;&lt;span lang="" about="https://www.master-7rqtwti-uu4o3wqcnw2yk.us.platform.sh/user/1" typeof="schema:Person" property="schema:name" datatype="" xml:lang=""&gt;ilrweb admin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Fri, 05/11/2018 - 14:46&lt;/span&gt;


  &lt;div class="text-long"&gt;
    &lt;div&gt;How is it collected?&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Through a survey of Internet Association’s (IA) member companies, along with publicly available resources from those companies.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="text-long"&gt;
    &lt;div&gt;Who collects it?&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Internet Association, a trade association of Internet-based companies.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="text-long"&gt;
    &lt;div&gt;What is it measuring?&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The number of accounts ("online income positions," or OIPs) held by workers on Internet Association member platforms.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="text-long"&gt;
    &lt;div&gt;What does it tell us?&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As of 2017, there were approximately 23.9 million Online Internet Positions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="text-long"&gt;
    &lt;div&gt;Considerations&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Many workers hold accounts on multiple platforms, and so this measure does not tell us the number of workers using these platforms. In addition, it does not account for how active accounts are; many accounts may not be in use.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Although the one-time data point is no longer accurate, it represents a unique approach to measurement and the potential for companies to share data.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="text-long"&gt;
    &lt;div&gt;How to access this data?&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Privately held by the Internet Association.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;



